                <l xml:id="m-531d95f9-952c-4388-8492-53313264dc0c" facs="#m-cae45f76-222b-404c-9812-8a498993f1d2" label="text-like">Common of Two or More Martyrs. At None. 1155</l><l xml:id="m-4b99f7cc-9694-4877-afcb-236c4a3511b6" facs="#m-3920da80-2a6d-4784-8372-4c0acf79aa95" label="lyrics-like">W. Et glo-ri-ámini omnes récti córde. Gló-ri-a Pátri,</l><l xml:id="m-4cbe4ae8-67ec-4979-ac65-b5b1628c0760" facs="#m-98c9c41d-9e01-4e9d-9a7a-09f1f5cf8797" label="lyrics-like">et Fi-li-o, et Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-ba0bd0e6-1387-4f0b-ad07-ed1806387ec4" facs="#m-52e892a2-4748-4ff2-91db-1bb08fc1f090" label="lyrics-like">V. Exsúltent jústi in conspéctu Déi¬</l><l xml:id="m-c5fe2e61-cffb-4894-9d31-1e6df1daced9" facs="#m-174fce6e-24cd-4746-b5cb-51f68f637524" label="lyrics-like">R. Et delecténtur in laetitia.</l><l xml:id="m-5ee77e7b-05e7-451d-a822-be7409079945" facs="#m-d372e357-b208-44f3-b259-8cf63f8e5678" label="text-like">The Masses are found after and Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-5511d59a-75a6-43f5-a531-343296ac6b7e" facs="#m-c932a95f-0fa1-4d9d-b1c4-061fa9f2f819" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-cd1cf78a-4810-47b5-8881-724efce974e5" facs="#m-28f1c5f8-d119-45d8-b150-f0abe5df7be0" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Córpora Sanctórum. D. 1153. Psalms of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-7ab1a687-027c-4c6d-80cd-c7ba5a4d3791" facs="#m-487e253c-0379-409a-a9d6-c7dbd75af1c4" label="ambiguous">Sap. 10. d.</l><l xml:id="m-7bb0a784-35a7-4104-9990-a02d4a9d23d8" facs="#m-037be930-14fd-4131-9a2e-d2bbc6c35dd9" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-a9b9fc44-5f1c-4b37-861d-f5aa72cdb83a" facs="#m-8793d17c-171d-41ef-a6b7-a8b5ba864896" label="lyrics-like">DEddidit Deus mercédem labó-] illis in velaménto diéi, * et in luce</l><l xml:id="m-8d720273-ed50-4d34-a295-733500186f51" facs="#m-c1fc4ffc-4fe0-48c0-ae89-85b65bd19096" label="lyrics-like">1t rum Sanctórum suórum, t et stellárum nocte.</l><l xml:id="m-c0a9ec7e-6ad1-4ee7-b905-c75160361691" facs="#m-0140b6e3-6001-4cf0-ac48-5f37c361b3c8" label="lyrics-like">dedúxit illos in via mirábili : et fuit</l><l xml:id="m-2c2e3307-6ac6-494a-bffa-7109f99c3648" facs="#m-2ade5f0e-9403-4236-b9f9-821365bc79c9" label="ambiguous">short!</l><l xml:id="m-f85f91ca-018d-4cf9-a50d-7d6d77a61fad" facs="#m-921b3975-c993-40eb-abca-05f3a035cc3d" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-5f1e1c28-0f16-4f7b-8f3b-937849783f36" facs="#m-3c526320-dde3-403a-b9c8-fe4883f60347" label="lyrics-like">Xsúltent jústi“n conspé-ctu Dé-i. V. Et de¬</l><l xml:id="m-3e307fa1-ac68-469d-95f1-f4f12b37e388" facs="#m-fe46c355-b96d-4640-8016-d05819684927" label="lyrics-like">lecténtur in laetí-ti-a. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-6ca257be-9efe-4fd0-acc1-7e313cd02de8" facs="#m-fbead667-95b9-4849-934a-3b3652c7fc3c" label="lyrics-like">V. Jústi autem in perpétuum vivent.</l><l xml:id="m-bece358a-6cbe-4301-a5a3-05362757ad62" facs="#m-64fb00dd-0fbb-4612-a227-79f5282748a3" label="lyrics-like">R. Et apud Dóminum est mérces eórum.</l><l xml:id="m-549c68bb-0d79-4835-af5e-8338f8c571b8" facs="#m-f1a53e6a-5351-463a-bb71-92c2b8506371" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-42375909-52c2-4be7-bfe5-20e6a6cc9410" facs="#m-d3c9a551-82fa-4e49-9eab-cb645e31d204" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Mártyrum chórus. p. 1154. Psalms of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-6bad66ec-5f85-4405-892f-ab22e3172f90" facs="#m-8a00ffd9-ac38-45c6-8744-19b0b2f961b3" label="ambiguous">Sap. 3. b.</l><l xml:id="m-16c3a3ae-edf8-4d61-8293-65a7af24aeb0" facs="#m-4784495d-1fae-471a-9669-1940838bb028" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-f4021c94-695c-4e1b-99d7-7a074c8c5cdd" facs="#m-f7569305-8acd-4a3c-9e7f-69c5daa3b6fc" label="lyrics-like">YUlgébunt justi, et tamquam scin-]minabúntur pópulis:“ et regnábit</l><l xml:id="m-90983898-1cc3-4fca-90f0-a0a5d7ff06bc" facs="#m-eeecdc1b-04ea-47f7-ae66-61337a863be1" label="lyrics-like">1tiilae in arundinéto discúr- Dóminus illórum in perpétuum.</l><l xml:id="m-8b6d3b47-0bf9-400f-bd98-bdf10dc569bc" facs="#m-935b1b54-c834-4f78-9a0a-3ffd52a1974a" label="lyrics-like">rent- t Judicábunt natiónes, et do¬</l><l xml:id="m-f1a13234-a57c-41e0-92bd-e2b6a2cac970" facs="#m-2c88cb2c-7583-48b9-a7d6-17d172171174" label="ambiguous">Short</l><l xml:id="m-dce6a572-32b8-44a7-adf8-569a260bceb1" facs="#m-b9a802c9-0ec1-40a3-8d13-a6feafe47d6a" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-7fb969b2-ad6a-4419-b88e-849677dc83b5" facs="#m-e2857500-d277-436b-b7c3-faab3d93edab" label="lyrics-like">Usti autem“ In perpé-tu-um ví-vent. V. Et apud</l><l xml:id="m-a292fd6c-9dbb-49c6-8c54-8476cf9f35aa" facs="#m-0059544d-1a1c-4e46-9261-2dcf62c7608a" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum est mérces e-ó-rum. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-9459288a-697d-45c6-9bec-c9a9859f73f0" facs="#m-d5e85694-d27c-49eb-aee3-8fbfd18bd232" label="lyrics-like">v. Exsultábunt Sáncti in glória.</l><l xml:id="m-0d515309-c3bd-4d51-8dea-96dd98fa205b" facs="#m-a020ba92-92e3-46cd-ac14-be9892b85b9d" label="lyrics-like">R. Laetabúntur in cubilibus súis.</l></lg>
